doctype html
html(lang='en')
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    meta(name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    meta(name='csrf-token' content=csrfToken)
    title Import AmiAmi items
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/color-theme.css')
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/amiami-upload.css')
    script(src='/js/amiami-upload.js' defer)
  body
    main
      nav(aria-label='Navigation')
        a(href='/admin') Administration
        a(href='/admin/amiami-items') AmiAmi items
      header
        p.eyebrow AmiAmi catalog
        h1 Import items from HTML
        p Copy the New Products page HTML in your browser, then paste it here or upload a saved HTML file. A whole page, a container or a single item link will work.
      p#upload-status(role='status' aria-live='polite') Checking for a previous import…
      noscript This form needs JavaScript to upload HTML and display progress.
      section#job-panel(hidden aria-labelledby='job-heading')
        .heading-row
          h2#job-heading Import progress
          span#job-state.badge
        p#job-message
        progress#job-progress(max='1' value='0')
        p#job-summary
        dl.stats
          div
            dt Found in HTML
            dd#job-total 0
          div
            dt Already in catalog
            dd#job-existing 0
          div
            dt Fetched
            dd#job-fetched 0
          div
            dt Failed
            dd#job-failed 0
        p#job-timing
        p#job-current
        p#background-note You can close this page. The import continues in the background; reopen it to see progress. Only one import can run at a time.
        details#failure-panel(hidden)
          summary Items that could not be fetched
          ul#job-failures
        p.job-reference#job-reference
      section#upload-panel(hidden aria-labelledby='upload-heading')
        h2#upload-heading Add an HTML list
        p Existing items are skipped, including items with a previous fetch error. Missing items are fetched one at a time, with a 60-second pause after each attempt.
        form#upload-form
          label(for='html-file') Upload a saved HTML file
          input#html-file(type='file' accept='.html,.htm,text/html')
          p.or Or paste the HTML
          label(for='html-input') HTML fragment or document
          textarea#html-input(rows='10' spellcheck='false' placeholder='<a href="/eng/detail?gcode=TOY-RBT-9417">…</a>')
          p.help Up to 2 MiB of UTF-8 HTML and 1,000 distinct item codes. HTML is parsed as text and discarded; it is never displayed or executed.
          button#upload-submit(type='submit') Start import
      button#refresh-status.secondary(type='button') Refresh status
